---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /glossary/index.html
pageTitle: 术语表
bodyClass: page-glossary
---
<nav class="back"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">← 返回目录</a></nav>
<article class="glossary-page">
  <h1>术语表</h1>
  <p>列传里的蓝色词语可以点开解释。以下解释也可直接浏览；词义会随具体战斗和发言语境变化。</p>
  <dl class="glossary-list">
    {% for entry in glossaryEntries %}
    <div id="{{ entry.id }}">
      <dt>{{ entry.term }}{% if entry.status == '待复核' %}<small class="glossary-draft">待复核</small>{% endif %}</dt>
      <dd><strong>{{ entry.meaning }}</strong>。{{ entry.note }}{% if entry.avoid %}<span class="glossary-avoid">不要误作：{{ entry.avoid }}。</span>{% endif %}</dd>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </dl>
</article>
